> I was playing hack(1.0.1) the other day, and for the first time,
> I reached the maze, and found the amulet.  But, it was in the lower left
> hand corner.  I used the wand of digging to kill the walls on every side,
> but, of course, the outside.  I found no way to budge the rock.
> 
> Question:  If you are fourtunate enough to find the amulet in the corner of
> the maze, is there any way to get it??????

Wish for a pick-axe and apply it to the boulder, turning it into an
easily moved pile of rocks.

By the way, here's a property of pick-axes that might either be a bug
or a feature.  If you stand on Elbereth, wield a pick-axe, and hit a
monster, the monster attacks.  But if you stand on Elbereth and apply
the pick-axe to the monster, you (seem to) do just as much damage to
the monster, but it doesn't attack.  You can stand on Elbereth all day
and wipe out all comers without taking a single hit.

